# Docs pipeline outputs. `site/` is the built MkDocs site (already matched by
# the Python block above; repeated here because this is where it comes from),
# and `.docs-check/` is where the docs drift check regenerates the registry
# pages so it can diff them without touching the working tree.
/site/
/.docs-check/

